## 3. Requirements

### 3.1 Functional Requirements
1. The system must support 500 concurrent users across various applications.
2. Data storage must accommodate a minimum of 100 TB with a growth plan for 30% annual increase.
3. The network must ensure a minimum uptime of 99.99%.

### 3.2 Non-Functional Requirements
1. System response time for user requests must not exceed 2 seconds.
2. The architecture must be scalable to support future growth without significant reconfiguration.
3. All systems must be compliant with ISO 27001 standards for information security management.

### 3.3 Compliance and Regulatory Requirements
1. Compliance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) for data privacy.
2. Adherence to the Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act (HIPAA) for handling sensitive information.
3. Regular audits and penetration testing as per the requirements set by the CISO, David Lee.

